| R4 ML Forbidden | PENDING | No ML, fixed multipliers (P3 sweeps bounded ranges), no adaptive parameters tied to PnL, single position per magic. PASS. The dynamic VWAP TP is *time-conditional* (VWAP evolves with the session), NOT *PnL-conditional* — it's not an adaptive-parameter R4 violation. |

